Library           json      

*** Variables ***


*** Keywords ***

Get L2PS Resources Usage
        [Documentation]                 KW used to send the getResourcesUsage command to CPRT through AaShell
        ...                             and return values related to L2PS: 
        ...                             nbOfFreeCRNTI, dlCellResources/nbOfHarqPoolFree, ulCellResources/nbOfHarqPoolFree
        ...                             Output: Dictonary with key/value corresponding to AsShell output of the wanted cells group.
        ...                             e.g.: 
        ...                             This part get through each line of the reported output. Here is an example:
        ...                              ...
        ...                               "l2resource": {
        ...                               "l2psList": {
        ...                               "l2psInfo": [
        ...                               {
        ...                                "l2psPoolId": 1,
        ...                                "cellGroupResources": [
        ...                                 {
        ...                                  "nrCellGrpId": 0,
        ...                                  "cellResources": [
        ...                                   {
        ...                                    "nrCellIdentity": "16385",
        ...                                    "dlCellResources": {
        ...                                     "nbOfHarqPoolFree": 400
        ...                                    },
        ...                                    "ulCellResources": {
        ...                                     "nbOfHarqPoolFree": 400
        ...                                    }
        ...                                   }
        ...                                  ],
        ...                                  "nbOfFreeCRNTI": 1681
        ...                                 }
        ...                                ]
        ...                               }
        ...                               ]
        ...                               },
        [Arguments]                     ${cell_index}=0

        ${nodeCPRT}                     Get Node                CPRT
        ${nodeId}=                      Get Regexp Matches      '${nodeCPRT}'         NodeId=(......)       1

        # Run commnand through AaShell 
        ${output}                       SSH Wait For Connect and Exec
        ...                             command=echo "getResourcesUsage @Cprt #${nodeId}[0]" | nc 0 15007
        ...                             host=${GNB_DU.sys[0].M}

        # Remove unexpected "AaShell> " strings from output
        ${clean_output}                 Remove String           ${output}               AaShell>

        # Move to robot dictionary
        ${source_data}=                 Evaluate                json.loads('''${clean_output}''')    json
        #Dated Log                       Source data: ${source_data} 

        ${l2ps_data}=                   Set Variable           ${source_data}[l2resource][l2psList][l2psInfo]
        #Dated Log                       L2PS data: ${l2ps_data} 
        # Look for wanted cell group index
        ${num_items}                    Get Length              ${l2ps_data}
        FOR                             ${i}                    IN RANGE                ${num_items}
                ${nrCellGrp}            Set Variable            ${l2ps_data}[${i}][cellGroupResources][0][nrCellGrpId]
                Exit For Loop If        ${nrCellGrp}==${cell_index} 
        END           

        ${nbFreeRnti}                   Set Variable
        ...                             ${l2ps_data}[${i}][cellGroupResources][0][nbOfFreeCRNTI]
        ${nbFreeDlHarq}                 Set Variable
        ...                             ${l2ps_data}[${i}][cellGroupResources][0][cellResources][0][dlCellResources][nbOfHarqPoolFree]
        ${nbFreeUlHarq}                 Set Variable
        ...                             ${l2ps_data}[${i}][cellGroupResources][0][cellResources][0][ulCellResources][nbOfHarqPoolFree]
        &{l2ps_cell_resource}           Create Dictionary        nbOfFreeCRNTI=${nbFreeRnti}
        ...                             DlnbOfHarqPoolFree=${nbFreeDlHarq}
        ...                             UlnbOfHarqPoolFree=${nbFreeUlHarq}

        Dated Log                       L2PS cell resource for nrCellGrp ${cell_index} is: ${l2ps_cell_resource}

        [Return]                        ${l2ps_cell_resource}


Test Teardown for CNI72046
        [Documentation]    Perform needed actions at the end of a test case
        Dated log                       Test teardown : start

        # Stop Sherpa if needed
        Run Keyword If                  ${enable_sherpa} == ${True}             Sherpa.Deactivate Sherpa and Stop Collect
        # "Test Teardown" KW from Setup.robot
        Test Teardown
        Dated log                       Test teardown : end
